---
/**
 * Alternate homepage: every project as a full-width "folio" card that pins and recedes
 * as the next one scrolls over it. Adapted from Subframe's "Folio stack" motion example
 * (https://www.subframe.com/motion/folio-stack) — rebuilt for whole-page scroll in plain Astro.
